---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';

const lastUpdated = 'April 2026';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`Now — ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="What Jon Spraggins is working on right now." />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<article class="prose">
				<div class="now-header">
					<h1>Now</h1>
					<span class="updated-badge">Updated {lastUpdated}</span>
				</div>

				<p class="now-intro">
					What I'm actually working on, as of right now. Inspired by <a href="https://nownownow.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">nownownow.com</a>.
				</p>

				<h2>Self</h2>
				<p>
					I saw Weird Al when he came to town.  Phenominal birthday gift from my brother.
				</p>
				<p>
					Always trying to convince myself to go to the gym, but walks are where it's at right now.  Podcasts and pavement.
				</p>

				<h2>Work</h2>
				<p>
					The name of the game is scale and feature-parity, folks.  Like off-brand Daleks screaming 'APPROXIMATE! APPROXIMATE!'
				</p>

				<h2>Homelab</h2>
				<p>
					Fun fact: pushing a model that's JUST barely big enough to fit in your VRAM means you get to have a slightly smarter model that melts down after the 2nd or 3rd question.  I dropped my local AI box to phi-4; While slower, it can parse a log and deliver deltas like a champ.
				</p>

				<h2>Writing</h2>
				<p>
					Lacking the discipline to really log anything lately, I'll admit.  Trying though.
				</p>

			</article>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.prose h1 { margin-bottom: 0.25em; }
	.prose h2 { margin-top: 2em; font-size: 1.3em; }

	.now-header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: baseline;
		gap: 1em;
		margin-bottom: 0.5em;
	}

	.updated-badge {
		font-size: 0.75em;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
		border: 1px solid var(--bg-border);
		padding: 0.2em 0.6em;
		border-radius: 4px;
	}

	.now-intro {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-size: 0.95em;
		margin-top: 0;
	}

	.now-intro a {
		color: var(--accent);
	}
</style>
